[{"client_msg_id":"9fdf2ac7-e21d-4fea-b688-eded0be27ff6","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"ミームとかのあたりを潜ってるときに見つけたやつなんですけどね、忘れちゃったな…","ts":"1626619613.471700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HHU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3819e3ba-c488-4e32-8eb4-4a2b2c672b6e","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"みたいななにかあったっけ...","ts":"1626619570.471300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IkH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"242aeb6e-eaf2-44e3-8f65-ac4c7cda1db6","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"粘菌のネットワークの話題とかは覚えてるけど、菌類と情報ネットワーク?","ts":"1626619548.470900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eoRLO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9cc7c18d-7390-4718-b44d-db7ff198ac5b","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"アレこれなんだっけ。昔それこそ情報と菌類を結びつけて、情報の遺伝子みたいな研究してる論文あったような","ts":"1626619496.470000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y7aM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2ea3c5b5-674b-4f9a-bafe-41e2db1c03c7","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"経済だけは東スポレベルなので眉唾として見てる。","ts":"1626619448.469400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xh34"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b2632890-9447-427b-b71a-d0e385173da3","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"サイエンスが好き","ts":"1626619416.468900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"utl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c3dd0457-db30-4a70-a375-f70521bb292a","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"日経は経済以外はある程度信用していいと思います。","ts":"1626619399.468700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"fukaikousatsu","count":1,"users":["UKHUVMBJR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MD/Hn"}]},{"client_m